cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TRA"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python package and command line (tra): autonomous trading agents with deterministic execution.
  Language model agents read the market and propose a trade; fixed, tested rules compute every
  figure, price the round trip, size the position and decide whether an order goes out.
authors:
  - name: "Bijective Labs"
    website: "https://www.bijectivelabs.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BijectiveLabs/trading-research-agents"
url: "https://www.bijectivelabs.dev/open-source"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - algorithmic trading
  - cryptocurrency
  - trading agents
  - large language models
  - risk management
  - backtesting
  - ccxt
